    "/clauses/hedge/16": "Draft (sign-off 2026-10-12, Part D D7: the lead chose \"Treat \\\"+/-\\\" as a hedge (a new draft row)\"): the chart notation \"+/-\" (present or absent) hedges its clause, so it records nothing and asks; before the sign-off the engine read no \"+/-\" at all",
    "/clauses/redFlags/rf_progressive/18": "Draft (sign-off 2026-10-12, Part D D8, wording option \"Progressive & one-ear\", approved by the clinical lead in chat): chart wording of rf_progressive (review round 3: the held-out corpus missed rf_progressive)",
