    "/clauses/redFlags/rf_asym/9": "Draft (sign-off 2026-10-12, Part D D8, wording option \"Progressive & one-ear\", approved by the clinical lead in chat): chart wording of rf_asym (review round 3: the held-out corpus missed rf_asym); the option's fourth phrase \"unilateral tinnitus\" was already a row (rf_asym[1], row 212, approved on the sign-off page) and is not listed twice",
